Package: tpad
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lightweight GTK text editor
 Tpad is a small, fast GTK 3 editor for plain text and source files. It
 provides syntax highlighting, spelling support, hashing tools, and native
 system printing while keeping a traditional multi-window interface.
